msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha kibodi-skrini kutoonekana kwa uhakika kwenye Phosh na mazingira"
" ya Linux yanayotumia kugusa"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:180
msgid "Fixed blob URL downloads (e.g. Save Image from the media viewer)"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha vipakuliwa vya URL ya blob (mfano, Hifadhi Picha kutoka kwa "
