#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:181
msgid "Redesigned application icons for stable and development variants"
msgstr "Imeundwa upya ikoni za programu kwa lahaja thabiti na za maendeleo"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:182
msgid "Updated all Rust dependencies to latest versions"
msgstr "Imesasisha vitegemezi vyote vya Rust hadi matoleo ya hivi karibuni"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:183
msgid "Upgraded to GNOME Platform 50"
msgstr "Imeinuliwa hadi Jukwaa la GNOME 50"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:184
msgid "Removed ffmpeg-full extension (no longer required)"
msgstr "Imeondoa kiendelezi cha ffmpeg-full (hakihitajiki tena)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:191
msgid "Fixed freezes when viewing media galleries"
msgstr "Imerekebisha kuganda wakati wa kutazama maghala ya media"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:192
msgid "Fixed crash on launch due to memory pressure threshold ordering"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha kuanguka wakati wa kuanza kutokana na mpangilio wa kizingiti "
"cha shinikizo la kumbukumbu"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:193
msgid "Fixed download destination and context menu issues"
msgstr "Imerekebisha masuala ya marudio ya vipakuliwa na menyu ya muktadha"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:194
msgid "Fixed dead key composition for first character in input fields"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha utunzi wa kibonye kifu kwa herufi ya kwanza katika sehemu za "
"kuingiza"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:195
msgid ""
"Added GStreamer/PipeWire env vars to production Flatpak for efficient media "
"handling"
msgstr ""
"Imeongeza vigeu vya mazingira vya GStreamer/PipeWire kwa Flatpak ya "
"uzalishaji kwa utunzaji bora wa media"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:202
msgid "Fixed download destination handling"
msgstr "Imerekebisha utunzaji wa marudio ya vipakuliwa"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:203
msgid "Resolved WebKit crashes on media-heavy pages"
msgstr "Imetatua kuanguka kwa WebKit kwenye kurasa zenye media nyingi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:210
msgid "Fixed: Download destination path handling regression"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebishwa: kurudi nyuma kwa utunzaji wa njia ya marudio ya vipakuliwa"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:217
msgid ""
"Fixed: JS injection and path traversal vulnerabilities in download handling"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebishwa: udhaifu wa udungaji wa JS na upitishaji wa njia katika "
"utunzaji wa vipakuliwa"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:224
msgid ""
"Fixed: Handle WebKit web process crashes with auto-reload and user "
"notification"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebishwa: Shughulikia kuanguka kwa michakato ya wavuti ya WebKit kwa "
"kupakia upya kiotomatiki na arifa kwa mtumiaji"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:225
msgid "Fixed: JS injection and path traversal vulnerabilities"
msgstr "Imerekebishwa: udhaifu wa udungaji wa JS na upitishaji wa njia"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:226
msgid "Fixed: Panic in notification handling"
msgstr "Imerekebishwa: Hofu katika utunzaji wa arifa"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:233
msgid "Added complete multi-account support with sidebar and tray integration"
msgstr ""
"Imeongeza usaidizi kamili wa akaunti nyingi ukiwa na upau wa pembeni na "
"uunganishaji wa treya"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:234
msgid "Added per-account zoom settings and improved accessibility"
msgstr "Imeongeza mipangilio ya ukuzaji kwa kila akaunti na kuboresha ufikivu"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:235
msgid "Fixed startup race conditions and resource usage issues"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha hali za mashindano wakati wa kuanza na masuala ya matumizi ya "
"rasilimali"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:242
msgid ""
"Added Zoom support (Ctrl +/-/0) with persistence and preference controls"
msgstr ""
"Imeongeza usaidizi wa Ukuzaji (Ctrl +/-/0) ukiwa na udumishaji na vidhibiti "
"vya mapendeleo"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:243
msgid "Fixed window size increasing on every restart"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha ukubwa wa dirisha kuongezeka kila wakati wa kuanzisha upya"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:250
msgid ""
"Fixed: Resolved webview reload loop on startup due to incorrect window size "
"detection"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebishwa: Imetatua kitanzi cha kupakia upya cha webview wakati wa "
"kuanza kutokana na ugunduzi usio sahihi wa ukubwa wa dirisha"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:257
msgid ""
"Added WebRTC permission handling in preparation for WhatsApp Web voice/video"
" calls"
msgstr ""
"Imeongeza utunzaji wa ruhusa ya WebRTC katika maandalizi ya simu za "
"sauti/video za WhatsApp Web"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:258
msgid "Improved mobile UI resizing consistency"
msgstr "Imeboresha uthabiti wa kubadilisha ukubwa wa UI ya simu"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:265
msgid ""
"Fixed: App now respects system \"Do Not Disturb\" settings on GNOME "
"(silences sounds)"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebishwa: Programu sasa inaheshimu mipangilio ya mfumo ya \"Usisumbue\""
" kwenye GNOME (inanyamazisha sauti)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:266
msgid "Fixed: Notifications bypass DND visuals (priority lowered to Normal)"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebishwa: Arifa zinapita maonyesho ya DND (kipaumbele kimepunguzwa hadi"
" Kawaida)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:273
msgid "Fixed tray icons on KDE/GNOME (visible on both light/dark themes)"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha ikoni za treya kwenye KDE/GNOME (zinaonekana kwenye mandhari "
"nyepesi/nyeusi)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:274
msgid "Restored correct app icons and transparent backgrounds"
msgstr "Imerejesha ikoni sahihi za programu na mandharinyuma ya uwazi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:275
msgid "Improved icon compatibility across desktop environments"
msgstr "Imeboresha uoanifu wa ikoni katika mazingira ya eneo-kazi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:282
msgid ""
"Fixed application freezing on resume by reverting aggressive cache "
"optimization"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha kuganda kwa programu wakati wa kurejea kwa kubatilisha "
"uboreshaji mkali wa akiba"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:283
msgid "Fixed background validation to ensure app starts correctly"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha uthibitishaji wa mandharinyuma ili kuhakikisha programu inaanza"
" vizuri"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:284
msgid "Optimized memory usage in mobile responsive scripts"
msgstr "Imeboresha matumizi ya kumbukumbu katika hati za kuitikia simu"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:285
msgid "Improved icon rendering (symbolic icons now use currentColor)"
msgstr ""
"Imeboresha uonyeshaji wa ikoni (ikoni za alama sasa zinatumia currentColor)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:292
msgid "Fixed window resize behavior to prevent excessive reloading"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha tabia ya kubadilisha ukubwa wa dirisha ili kuzuia upakiaji upya"
" wa kupita kiasi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:293
msgid "Fixed background notifications reliability"
msgstr "Imerekebisha uaminifu wa arifa za mandharinyuma"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:300
msgid "Fixed Flatpak build failure by correcting config"
msgstr "Imerekebisha kushindwa kwa ujenzi wa Flatpak kwa kusahihisha usanidi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:307
msgid "Fixed \"Too many open files\" crash by reusing notification resources"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha kuanguka kwa \"Faili nyingi mno zimefunguliwa\" kwa kutumia "
"tena rasilimali za arifa"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:308
msgid "Fixed zombie process accumulation"
msgstr "Imerekebisha mkusanyiko wa michakato zombi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:309
msgid "Improved overall stability"
msgstr "Imeboresha uthabiti kwa ujumla"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:316
msgid "Ctrl+N keyboard shortcut for opening a new chat"
msgstr "Njia ya mkato ya kibodi ya Ctrl+N kwa kufungua gumzo jipya"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:317
msgid ""
"Mobile layout support with auto-detection for Phosh, Plasma Mobile, and "
"Lomiri"
msgstr ""
"Usaidizi wa mpangilio wa simu ukiwa na ugunduzi otomatiki kwa Phosh, Plasma "
"Mobile, na Lomiri"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:318
msgid "Tray icon click now toggles window visibility"
msgstr "Kubofya ikoni ya treya sasa kunageuza mwonekano wa dirisha"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:319
msgid "Window size is saved and restored when hiding/showing"
msgstr ""
"Ukubwa wa dirisha unahifadhiwa na kurejeshwa wakati wa kuficha/kuonyesha"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:320
msgid "Mobile layout setting changed to dropdown (auto/enabled/disabled)"
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio wa simu umebadilishwa kuwa menyu kunjuzi "
"(otomatiki/imewezeshwa/imezimwa)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:327
msgid ""
"Updated application summary and description for better AppStream compliance"
msgstr ""
"Imesasisha muhtasari na maelezo ya programu kwa uzingatifu bora wa AppStream"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:334
msgid ""
"Notification Chat Linking: Clicking a notification now opens the specific "
"chat in Karere."
msgstr ""
"Kuunganisha Gumzo la Arifa: Kubofya arifa sasa kunafungua gumzo mahususi "
"katika Karere."

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:335
msgid ""
"Webcam Support: Added support for using the webcam (Status updates, Video "
