"✨ Usaidizi Ulioboreshwa wa Emoji, Utunzaji wa Viungo vya Nje, na Maboresho "
"ya Ujenzi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:579
msgid ""
"Added high-quality Noto Color Emoji fonts (v2.047, Unicode 16.0 support)"
