"Imeongeza fonti za ubora wa juu za Noto Color Emoji (v2.047, usaidizi wa "
"Unicode 16.0)"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:580
msgid "Enhanced WebKit rendering with maximum hardware acceleration"
msgstr ""
"Imeboresha uonyeshaji wa WebKit ukiwa na uongezaji kasi wa juu wa maunzi"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:581
